  "summary": "Quiet week for loader tractors in the 90-140hp band near Darlington Point: most dealer stock is either over 4,500 hours, has no loader, or is over budget. Two NSW dealer Kubotas with loaders came up on FarmMachinerySales, both low hours and in band. Discs, rippers and container cabins are steady; two prices dropped. The AuctionsPlus multi-vendor sale closed on 19 Nov and Pickles' 1,000 L tank sale has ended.",
