    "New: 2022 Kubota M9540DH, 95hp, Kubota loader and 4-in-1, 1,886 hours, $52,800, NSW dealer (town not shown).",
    "New: 2021 Kubota M108S, 105hp, loader, 1,440 hours, $79,990, NSW dealer (town not shown).",
    "Discs: new DiscX 24-plate, 2.6m, $22,600 at Wodonga; not listed, six cheaper used units already cover it.",
    "Price drop: John Deere 5093E at Culcairn is now $75,000, down from $79,000.",
    "Price drop: 2010 container accommodation at Young is now $15,000, down from $19,000.",
    "Closed: AuctionsPlus JD 6830 (bid $90,000) and Deutz M600 (bid $67,000), 19 Nov. Pickles 1,000 L tank sale ended."
